{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c2bb7e89-ebd6-8073-a3dc-144cb1a462bf",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:42:25-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carlos Tavares",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:38:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:38:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. Um, I'm calling about a water bill. A water... bill. I think there's some mix-up about who is supposed to pay it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:38:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, happy to look at that with you. Whose name is the account under, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:38:51-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the thing. I'm a tenant. I rent. And my landlord says the tenant owes the water bill. The tenant. So he says that's me. I just want to know, whose is it, really?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:39:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, got it. Sorry, you're a little choppy on my end. Did you say your landlord is telling you the water bill is yours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:39:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Yes. [line breaks up] he sent me a copy, and says I owe it. Can you hear me okay now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:39:26-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Better now, yeah. So here's the general way it works. The city bills the property owner, since the account is tied to the property. Whether the tenant pays is usually something between you and the landlord, like in your lease. The city doesn't decide that part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:39:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The lease. Okay. So the city sends it to him, not me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:39:52-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Typically the bill goes to whoever is on the account, and that's normally the owner. Do you have the lease handy? If it says water is included or that you pay it, that's what governs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:40:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have it somewhere. Um, I'm not going to dig for it now. I just want it explained. I'm not asking to change anything. Not change. Explained."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:40:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, that's fair. And the bill he sent you, does it look like a city bill, or just a note from him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:40:29-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a copy of the city one. It looks high to me. Higher than I would expect. But, well, I had a plumber out recently. I kept the receipt, so, that's a... a receipt I have."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:40:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good that you kept it. Was the plumber fixing a leak?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:40:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A running toilet. It was running, I think, for weeks. [crosstalk] before I knew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:40:56-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll do it. A running toilet can add a lot of usage without anybody noticing. That would show up as a higher reading on the bill. So the receipt is useful to have, whoever ends up paying."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:41:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the high number could be from the toilet. Okay. That I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:41:18-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. The bill is based on the meter reading, how much water went through. It doesn't know if it went down a drain or out a leak. If you'd like, your landlord, as the account holder, can ask us about the usage on that account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:41:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. I'll tell him that. He didn't explain any of this. He just said, you owe it. You owe it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:41:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I'd bring the lease and the receipt to him and sort it out from there. Anything else on the bill confusing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:41:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. That's it. Honestly, I can't believe it's already December. This year, it just... went. Went by so fast."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:42:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tell me about it. Seems like summer was last week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:42:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Well. Thank you for explaining. That's all I wanted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:42:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, Mr. Tavares. Call back anytime if the landlord has questions. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:42:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
